 "text": "Torivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nResistors : Load banks\n\n+\n\nBoxed\n\nBraking resistors\n\nCemented\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nHelical\n\nLoad banks\n\nStarting resistors\n\nElectronic equipment\n\n+\n\nConverters\n\nDC power supplies\n\nIndustrial control\n\nRenewable energies\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM Series Covers\n\nBO series control buttons (bright)\n\nBO Series control buttons with line\n\nBO series covers\n\nCasing covers\n\nEstators\n\nGraded covers\n\nGraduated discs\n\nBraking resistors are intended to dissipate the energy generated by a motor during deceleration, preventing damage to the drive due to overvoltage and ensuring that it stops safely.\n\nTORIVAC is a manufacturer of different types of dynamic braking resistors, which offer an economical and small size solution for braking control by absorbing and dissipating energy efficiently and effectively. A braking resistor helps to slow down or stop a motor by dissipating the excess voltage generated by the decelerating motor. \n\nThese resistors can also help reduce wear on braking components, which can extend equipment life, enable faster braking and eliminate the risk of overheating.\n\n– Suitable for any application requiring dynamic braking.\n\n– Suitable for power from 1W to 100MW and duty cycle from 1% to 100%.\n\n– Suitable for all types of frequency inverters\n\n– Manufacture according to customer specifications\n\n– Small size range at very competitive prices.\n\n– They can be supplied in air (IP00 or in enclosure (from IP20 to IP54).\n\nCONTACT WITH US\n\nDo you need technical advice or a quotation?\n Write us and we will solve it for you\n\nIn Torivac you will find a wide range of specialized products for voltage regulation, designed to offer maximum performance in industrial applications and high demanding electrical systems. We have multiple sizes and formats, as well as custom manufacturing options that guarantee a solution adapted to every need. Our team of experts is ready to advise you on the best choice for your project. \n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\n\n*\nI agree to the privacy policy\nSend\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and Google’s Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\n\nExplore similar products\n\nHigh power cemented resistors\n\nResistors – Load bank\n\nStarting resistors\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nView full catalog",
 "text_chars": 3024,
